# Rampaging Spiketail (5/6): "When this creature enters, target creature you control gets +2/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn."
# Bot1 plays a Memnite on turn 1; Bot2 plays a Llanowar Elves on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Spiketail off two Black Lotuses ({4}{B}{B}):
# the trigger cannot target Bot2's Llanowar Elves (refused), and Bot1 targets its Memnite: a 3/1 with indestructible, power only. Bot1's
# Lightning Bolt (Mox Ruby) at the Memnite then marks lethal damage which does not destroy it (CR 702.12b); the Spiketail itself gets
# neither. On turn 5 the Memnite is a 1/1 with no keywords again (until end of turn).

